(a) Road renaming is strongly discouraged due to safety issues, but can be initiated by the county or by private individuals or groups. No county-owned road will be renamed except by resolution from the county board of commissioners. The renaming of private roads will only be undertaken if the planning department determines that the change will result in a clear benefit to the community. Acceptable reasons for changing road names are:
